Version 3.5.1 is a maintenance release focused on stability and data quality.
Fixes crashes and ANRs on the splash, home, TEI dashboard, search and sync screens, and when capturing polygons.
Program rules now hide fields and show warnings correctly, and rule errors no longer block enrollment editing.
Number validation now matches the server and duplicate unique attribute values are prevented.
Sync notifications can be dismissed and analytics tables show values correctly.
Includes SDK updates.
